{
  "ruleId": "DED-NPS-OWN",
  "_note": "An individual's own payment to the notified pension scheme, \"a deduction not exceeding ₹50000\" (s.124(3), p.160), with a parent's or guardian's deposit to a minor's account, \"the aggregate amount of deduction under sub-section (3) and this sub-section shall not exceed ₹50000\" (s.124(4)). No amount counted under s.123 counts here, nor the reverse (s.124(5), (10)): EMPLOYEE_NPS enters as what DED-SCHEDULE-XV's sub-cap left. The new regime computes total income without \"Chapter VIII other than the provisions of sections 124(1) and 124(2), or 125(2) or 146\" (s.202(2)(a)(xii), p.227) — s.124(3)–(4) are not named, so the old regime only. TY 2026-27 only (D-129 C2a). rulebook DED-NPS-SELF-001, -002, DED-NPS-MINOR-001. The 1961 counterpart, s.80CCD(1B), is unread (W-075d).",
